    "memory:memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-05-03.txt:101:101": {
      "key": "memory:memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-05-03.txt:101:101",
      "path": "memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-05-03.txt",
      "startLine": 101,
      "endLine": 101,
      "source": "memory",
      "snippet": "Assistant: 奇怪，手动运行完全正常但 Desktop 校验还是失败。这个校验逻辑和我的手动执行行为不一样，可能是 Electron 环境隔离导致的。让我换个方法 — 改 `installState` 让它重新走一遍完整安装流程：",
      "recallCount": 0,
      "dailyCount": 1,
      "groundedCount": 0,
      "totalScore": 0.58,
      "maxScore": 0.58,
      "firstRecalledAt": "2026-05-05T19:00:00.133Z",
      "lastRecalledAt": "2026-05-05T19:00:00.133Z",
      "queryHashes": [
        "b2bd51325196"
      ],
      "recallDays": [
        "2026-05-06",
        "2026-05-05"
      ],
      "conceptTags": [
        "奇怪",
        "运行",
        "完全",
        "正常",
        "desktop",
        "还是",
        "失败",
        "这个"
      ]
    },
    "memory:memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-05-03.txt:102:102": {
      "key": "memory:memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-05-03.txt:102:102",
      "path": "memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-05-03.txt",
      "startLine": 102,
      "endLine": 102,
      "source": "memory",
      "snippet": "Assistant: 找到了！当 `UV_PYTHON=\"\"`（空字符串）时，uv 找不到 `.venv`，直接报 exit code 2。问题是你之前设置了 `export UV_PYTHON=/opt/homebrew/bin/python3.12`，后来我把它注释掉了，但当时可能设成了空值。",
      "recallCount": 0,
      "dailyCount": 1,
      "groundedCount": 0,
      "totalScore": 0.58,
      "maxScore": 0.58,
      "firstRecalledAt": "2026-05-05T19:00:00.133Z",
      "lastRecalledAt": "2026-05-05T19:00:00.133Z",
      "queryHashes": [
        "b2bd51325196"
      ],
      "recallDays": [
        "2026-05-06",
        "2026-05-05"
      ],
      "conceptTags": [
        "uv-python",
        "opt/homebrew/bin/python3.12",
        "找到",
        "字符",
        "找不到",
        "venv",
        "直接",
        "exit"
      ]
    },
    "memory:memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-05-03.txt:103:103": {
      "key": "memory:memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-05-03.txt:103:103",
      "path": "memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-05-03.txt",
      "startLine": 103,
      "endLine": 103,
      "source": "memory",
      "snippet": "Assistant: 找到了！`UV_PYTHON` 是 **launchd 级别**的环境变量（系统级），所有 GUI 应用都继承它。这就是为什么改 `~/.zshrc` 没用的原因。",
      "recallCount": 0,
      "dailyCount": 1,
      "groundedCount": 0,
      "totalScore": 0.58,
      "maxScore": 0.58,
      "firstRecalledAt": "2026-05-05T19:00:00.133Z",
      "lastRecalledAt": "2026-05-05T19:00:00.133Z",
      "queryHashes": [
        "b2bd51325196"
      ],
      "recallDays": [
