      "path": "memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-05-03.txt",
      "startLine": 104,
      "endLine": 104,
      "source": "memory",
      "snippet": "Assistant: 成功了！之前那个损坏的 interpreter 缓存导致 exit code 2，用 `-v` 运行一次后缓存被清理，现在恢复正常：",
